    "wacc_rationale": "USD build: 10y UST ~4.3%, ERP 5.0%, beta ~1.0-1.1 (water-technology industrial, roughly half municipal non-discretionary) -> cost of equity ~9.5%; pre-tax debt ~5% (3.9% after tax) at ~10% of EV -> WACC ~9.0%. Same WACC in every scenario: cyclicality, M&A integration and data-center risk are charged in the scenario flows and weights, not in the rate.",
